    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-right: Black 1pt solid; text-align: center">MicroSectors<SUP>TM</SUP> Gold Miners -3X Inverse Leveraged ETNs due June 29, 2040</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-right: Black 1pt solid; text-align: center">GDXD</TD>
